ower-up on the fly with combat abilities and modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Roy Level Progression \u2013 Earn XP across runs to level up and push deeper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Customize Your Build \u2013 Stack upgrades to suit your playstyle: brute force, control, or speed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/f563294fe9efe09dc9d008d6c88a9b3c.avif?t=1755070321\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sullivan Facility is a living labyrinth of high-tech experimentation and ruthless control. Can you make it out?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Labs</strong> \u2013 Clinical, neon-lit testing chambers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Industrial Sectors</strong> \u2013 Steam-filled arenas and environmental hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corporate HQ</strong> \u2013 The final gauntlet\u2026 and your ultimate adversary</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/9bc2c421bf0eacf5a1b9f912b9b89118.avif?t=1755070321\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to escape the system that created you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Wishlist <i>Project Roy</i> to be the first to play this unique FPS roguelike.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
